      <marc:subfield code="a">Lee Hammond is back and better than ever, featuring all new step-by-step demonstrations that will have you drawing your best portraits yet. Her secret to success? The &quot;Hammond Blended Pencil Technique,&quot; a proven method of shading and blending that captures the soft tones and dimensional shapes of skin, hair and clothing. Focusing first on individual facial features, you&apos;ll follow her easy three-step process for realistically rendering even the most challenging eyes, noses and mouths. From there, you&apos;ll use Lee&apos;s basic grid techniques to master proportion and put the features together, then grad.</marc:subfield>
